      "writtenOn": "2026-07-29T10:50:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ah, I forgot that these MSRs themselves are per-CPU (unlike the XSS in aosp/4175819, for instance).\n\n\u003e To guarantee the host should call enable_virtualization_cpu, maybe the pkvm can fail the vm creation if the enable_virtualization_cpu is not called, by detecting the new per cpu variable we added by https://android-review.googlesource.com/c/kernel/common/+/4198684/1\n\nLet me think more about this...",
      "parentUuid": "bf59ef70_74b9400d",
      "revId": "a33471f42130f67e0c257bf91646f854a31aec54",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
