      "writtenOn": "2026-07-29T09:48:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because we have `VM_EXIT_LOAD_IA32_EFER`, when host vmexits to pKVM, the MSR_EFER is restored to pKVM\u0027s value automatically, which indicates the host is not able to modify the MSR_EFER seen by the pKVM. So the host is not able to change .cur via modifying its own EFER. Based on this, I also think we don\u0027t need to intercept MSR_EFER.",
      "parentUuid": "f19c6b26_411d20a5",
