      "message": "Ok, looking again on the code I think we can indeed drop `MSR_EFER` from here. I see that host VM (independently of this patch) writes to it only when `kvm_probe_user_return_msr` (via `vmx_setup_user_return_msrs` just to probe this MSR as it is hardcoded in `vmx_uret_msrs_list`) but then it does not update the .curr value anyway. So I think we can drop it from this list and keep MSR_EFER pass-through. But AFAIU keeping it will not be harmful anyway.",
